Quiet settled flight still paid npcJobs existence probe + 12-slot sleep
clear every tick with an empty job bag. Latch after first empty sleep when
npcJobs.revision is trustworthy; wake on revision bump from
_invalidateJobIds. Soft-GPU fps not claimed. Picture unchanged while no
job signatures are live.
